{
  "file_id": "ID03606",
  "text_count": 78,
  "dialog": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "english": "Ah! It's the princess, ribbit!",
      "_offset": 1328,
      "_length": 30,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "english": "Save us, ribbit!",
      "_offset": 1359,
      "_length": 16,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "english": "Everyone's all tired out...",
      "_offset": 1376,
      "_length": 27,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "english": "What on earth is going on?",
      "_offset": 1404,
      "_length": 26,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "english": "It's our lord's karaoke contest,\ntama.",
      "_offset": 1431,
      "_length": 38,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "english": "What do you mean?",
      "_offset": 1470,
      "_length": 17,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "english": "We're happy that the princess's\nsong woke up our lord, ribbit.",
      "_offset": 1488,
      "_length": 62,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "english": "Our lord has been singing karaoke\nfrom dawn to dusk, and we can't \nsleep from the sound, ribbit.",
      "_offset": 1551,
      "_length": 96,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "english": "So we need the prinshess's help,\ntama!",
      "_offset": 1648,
      "_length": 38,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "english": "Huh?! Me?",
      "_offset": 1687,
      "_length": 9,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "english": "We want you to make him lose his\nconfidence by beating him cold in\na karaoke contest, tama!",
      "_offset": 1697,
      "_length": 91,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "english": "But if she does that...",
      "_offset": 1789,
      "_length": 23,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "english": "Won't he start focusing *more*\non practicing karaoke?",
      "_offset": 1813,
      "_length": 53,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "english": "You're right, ribbit.",
      "_offset": 1867,
      "_length": 21,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "english": "That's not good, ribbit.",
      "_offset": 1889,
      "_length": 24,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "english": "I got an idea, tama!",
      "_offset": 1914,
      "_length": 20,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "english": "What is it, ribbit?",
      "_offset": 1935,
      "_length": 19,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "english": "I found the manual to make that\nmedicine, tama!",
      "_offset": 1955,
      "_length": 47,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "english": "Really, ribbit?",
      "_offset": 2003,
      "_length": 15,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "english": "Hey, I don't get what's going on\nhere...",
      "_offset": 2019,
      "_length": 40,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "english": "What's this medicine?",
      "_offset": 2060,
      "_length": 21,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "english": "In this castle, there's a recipe\nfor medicine to change the volume\nof TonosamaGekomon's voice.",
      "_offset": 2082,
      "_length": 94,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "english": "Huh... that's an interesting\nmedicine.",
      "_offset": 2177,
      "_length": 38,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "english": "If we make this medicine, we might\nbe able to soften our lord's\nvoice, ribbit.",
      "_offset": 2216,
      "_length": 78,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "english": "Then TonosamaGekomon can enjoy\nhis karaoke, and you can sleep in\npeace!",
      "_offset": 2295,
      "_length": 71,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "english": "Prinshess, we'd like you to help\nus make this medicine, tama!",
      "_offset": 2367,
      "_length": 61,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "english": "Okay! After all that trouble I\ngave you earlier, I'll have to\nwork hard for you guys!",
      "_offset": 2429,
      "_length": 85,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "english": "Hooraaaaaaaaay! Hooraaaaaaaaaaay!",
      "_offset": 2515,
      "_length": 33,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "english": "So the materials are hidden\nhere...",
      "_offset": 2549,
      "_length": 35,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "english": "We have to get three materials in\nall...",
      "_offset": 2585,
      "_length": 40,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "english": "I wonder why they divided it up\nand stored it in different places?",
      "_offset": 2626,
      "_length": 66,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "english": "Bet it's like how you'd separate a\nbank book and seal.",
      "_offset": 2693,
      "_length": 54,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "english": "I see, so they're valuable\nmaterials.",
      "_offset": 2748,
      "_length": 37,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "english": "(Wait, he could understand that\nanalogy!?)",
      "_offset": 2786,
      "_length": 42,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "english": "Anyway, we just need to get all\nthe materials and give 'em to the\nGekomon.",
      "_offset": 2829,
      "_length": 74,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "english": "Obtained a medicine material!",
      "_offset": 2904,
      "_length": 29,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "english": "Two materials left! Keep at it,\nMimi!",
      "_offset": 2934,
      "_length": 37,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "english": "Obtained a medicine material!",
      "_offset": 2972,
      "_length": 29,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "english": "One material left! One more, Mimi!",
      "_offset": 3002,
      "_length": 34,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "english": "Obtained a medicine material!",
      "_offset": 3037,
      "_length": 29,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "english": "Now we have to give these\nmaterials to the Gekomon.",
      "_offset": 3067,
      "_length": 51,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "english": "Finished, tama!",
      "_offset": 3119,
      "_length": 15,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "english": "We did it, ribbit!",
      "_offset": 3135,
      "_length": 18,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 43,
      "english": "It's thanks to the princess,\nribbit!",
      "_offset": 3154,
      "_length": 36,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 44,
      "english": "Isn't that great, Mimi?",
      "_offset": 3191,
      "_length": 23,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 45,
      "english": "Now we just have to get\nTonosamaGekomon to drink this.",
      "_offset": 3215,
      "_length": 54,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 46,
      "english": "Ugh...",
      "_offset": 3270,
      "_length": 6,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 47,
      "english": "No point in getting mad, Mimi.",
      "_offset": 3277,
      "_length": 30,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 48,
      "english": "Making the medicine is one thing,\nbut we haven't thought about how\nto get him to drink it...",
      "_offset": 3308,
      "_length": 92,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 49,
      "english": "This is shameful, ribbit.",
      "_offset": 3401,
      "_length": 25,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 50,
      "english": "Our lord is fussy about taste,\nribbit. We can't mix it in his\nfood, ribbit.",
      "_offset": 3427,
      "_length": 75,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 51,
      "english": "We'll have to force him to drink\nit after all...",
      "_offset": 3503,
      "_length": 48,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 52,
      "english": "Why am *I* the one who has to do\nthis?",
      "_offset": 3552,
      "_length": 38,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 53,
      "english": "Go for it, Mimi!",
      "_offset": 3591,
      "_length": 16,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 54,
      "english": "Fight, prinshess!",
      "_offset": 3608,
      "_length": 17,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 55,
      "english": "Ah! G-good morning...",
      "_offset": 3626,
      "_length": 21,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 56,
      "english": "Mimi! Run!",
      "_offset": 3648,
      "_length": 10,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 57,
      "english": "So *that's* how it goes?!",
      "_offset": 3659,
      "_length": 25,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 58,
      "english": "I didn't know that I was causing\neveryone trouble, ribbit.",
      "_offset": 3685,
      "_length": 58,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 59,
      "english": "I'll just keep it from morning to\nevening, ribbit.",
      "_offset": 3744,
      "_length": 50,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 60,
      "english": "We're indebted to you, princess!\nRibbit!",
      "_offset": 3795,
      "_length": 40,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 61,
      "english": "Thank you, ribbit!",
      "_offset": 3836,
      "_length": 18,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 62,
      "english": "Thank you! Now don't get into any\nmore disputes, okay?",
      "_offset": 3855,
      "_length": 54,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 63,
      "english": "All right then, byyyyyye~!",
      "_offset": 3910,
      "_length": 26,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 64,
      "english": "So the materials are hidden\nhere...",
      "_offset": 3937,
      "_length": 35,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 65,
      "english": "Three materials left! Keep at it,\nMimi!",
      "_offset": 3973,
      "_length": 39,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 66,
      "english": "So the materials are hidden\nhere...",
      "_offset": 4013,
      "_length": 35,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 67,
      "english": "Two materials left! Keep at it,\nMimi!",
      "_offset": 4049,
      "_length": 37,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 68,
      "english": "So the materials are hidden\nhere...",
      "_offset": 4087,
      "_length": 35,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 69,
      "english": "One material left! Keep at it,\nMimi!",
      "_offset": 4123,
      "_length": 36,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 70,
      "english": "Now we just have to give these\nmaterials to the Gekomon.",
      "_offset": 4160,
      "_length": 56,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 71,
      "english": "We don't have enough materials,\nribbit. We can't make the medicine\nwith this, ribbit...",
      "_offset": 4217,
      "_length": 87,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 72,
      "english": "I know, but I couldn't really find\nthem...",
      "_offset": 4305,
      "_length": 42,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 73,
      "english": "We need the princess to pull this\noff, ribbit!",
      "_offset": 4348,
      "_length": 46,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 74,
      "english": "It's okay! I'll figure it out. I\nhave three left.",
      "_offset": 4395,
      "_length": 49,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 75,
      "english": "It's okay! I'll figure it out. I\nhave two left.",
      "_offset": 4445,
      "_length": 47,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 76,
      "english": "It's okay! I'll figure it out. I\nhave one left.",
      "_offset": 4493,
      "_length": 47,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 77,
      "english": "Oh, these are all the materials!\nWe can make the medicine!",
      "_offset": 4541,
      "_length": 58,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    }
  ]
}